          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: бессонница",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "бессонница (bessónnitsa) — \"insomnia\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Из-за стресса у меня бессонница. Iz-za stréssa u menyá bessónnitsa. I've got insomnia because of stress."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "бессонница (bessónnitsa) is built on бессонный 'sleepless', from без 'without' and сон 'sleep', with -ница; EtymDB lists бессонный without a source and has no entry for бессонница (bessónnitsa)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
